Introdução à Física do Estado Sólido — Lucy V. C. Assali (@mat-ifusp-solid: 0, is #reference, #part-of @mat-sources) { r_3KCKPSW6FY72YA5689VPH8N5PS
Lucy V. C. Assali, IFUSP, second semester 2018, Portuguese. [Institutional page with twelve lecture files](https://portal.if.usp.br/scam/pt-br/node/355), [77-page semiconductor lecture](https://portal.if.usp.br/scam/sites/portal.if.usp.br.scam/files/Est_Sol_semicondutores_2S_2018_final_completa.pdf).

Use the lecture sequence alongside the English books, checking vocabulary such as rede, banda, portador, buraco, massa efetiva and impureza aceitadora. The first crystal-structure file contains 33 pages. These are slide companions rather than a claim of a complete self-contained textbook.

The institutional index, cover and selected semiconductor effective-mass and doping slides were inspected on 30 October 2026; the author's name was checked visually because extracted text is garbled. No general adaptation licence was established. Keep institutional links, authorship and credited components; source PDFs remain external.

